"-24.6058\"","\"22.8887\"","\"-1.075019551132218081411351452900339468821\"","\"15.1590\"","\"-39.7648\"","\"market_cap\"","\"reported_parent_PE\"","\"normalized_parent_PAT_excluding_all_other_income_at25pct\"","\"book_price_equity\"","\"normalized_gross_debt\"","\"net_debt_available_cash_only\"","\"net_debt_EBITDA\"","\"full_enterprise_value\"","\"capacity_arithmetic\"","\"external_sales_elimination\"","\"normalized_parent_PE\"","\"146.085795\"","\"16.12016761749224810478576078920362380411\"","\"8.3775296740312136624750\"","\"2.929402652560318275154004106776180698152\"","\"28.3579\"","\"26.3019\"","\"1.746984510746831743670129387071920082893\"","\"NS: economic market value of minority claim and available non-operating assets not verified; no misleading parent EV/group EBITDA comparison\"","\"KLPD\"","\"days_assumed\"","\"INR_per_litre_assumed\"","\"revenue_proxy\"","\"FY26_revenue_fraction_not_utilization\"","170","300","80","\"408\"","\"0.2990911764705882352941176470588235294118\"","\"6.1726\"","\"17.43781289761811734692896372230600073295\"","\"sessions\"","\"mean\"","\"median\"","\"absent_or_zero\"","\"conservative_daily_value\"","\"exit_days\"","\"one_lot_cost\"","\"whole_lots_within_5lakh\"","\"one_lot_fraction_of_median\"","20","\"1425105.00\"","\"603062.50\"","\"0.02\"","\"0.05\"","\"0.10\"","\"41.45507306456627629806197533423152658307\"","\"16.58202922582651051922479013369261063323\"","\"8.291014612913255259612395066846305316613\"","\"103850.00\"","\"0.1722043735102083117421494455383977614261\"","60","\"1752649.166666666666666666666666666666667\"","\"670550.00\"","6","\"37.28282752963984788606367906942062486019\"","\"14.91313101185593915442547162776824994408\"","\"7.456565505927969577212735813884124972038\"","\"0.1548728655581239281187085228543732756692\"","\"score\"","\"confidence\"","\"facts\"","\"contrary\"","\"Medium\"","\"AR26 auditors report no identified fraud, defaults or statutory auditor resignation and an unmodified opinion.\"","\"Related-party advances of 1.0378 crore to Deepprabha remain, and demand loans lack contractual repayment schedules; IPO proceeds fully deployed, including 12.20 crore working capital.\"","\"No substantiated diversion or minority abuse was established; related-party commercial dealings and short-duration director funding are disclosed. Demand-loan ambiguity warrants evidence, not a fraud allegation.\"","\"AR26 pp136–143,170–184\"","\"IPO risk discussion explicitly describes low entry barriers; customers are competitive OMC tenders rather than protected distribution.\"","\"Spot feedstock purchases have no long-term supplier contracts, while top-ten customers accounted for 85.98% in FY24 and 100% in the July2024 stub.\"","\"Multi-feedstock process capability, BIS-qualified supply and repeat OMC allocations are useful operating capabilities, but durable price power or structurally superior cash returns is not demonstrated.\"","\"IPO pp29–47,96–109\"","\"CALL25\"","\"Low for underlying demand; High for latest reported revenue\"","\"Reported FY23–26 revenue grows from 23.4085 to122.0292 crore, but March2024 acquisition makes the window non-constant scope.\"","\"FY25–26 revenue grows81.29%, but audited annual volume/ASP and external intercompany elimination bridge do not establish organic demand separately from feedstock/pricing and trading.\"","\"Physical IPO production and FY26 parent/subsidiary sales confirm material scaling; neither a large reported CAGR nor capacity arithmetic supplies the missing comparable organic endpoint.\"","\"IPO F50–58 and p153\"","\"AR25\"","\"AR26 pp144–146\"","\"PRES26\"","\"Existing group biodiesel capacity is stated as170KLPD across Phulera and Meerut, with repeat OMC allocations.\"","\"An October6 CBG filing increases project registration to18TPD but still requires establishment approvals; no commissioned CBG earnings or binding subsidy proceeds are verified.\"","\"Renewable-fuel policy and byproducts provide plausible demand access; feedstock availability, tender price, dispatch and collection determine accessible economics, not national blending targets.\"","\"CBG26\"","\"LOI26\"","\"Low for incremental cohort economics\"","\"FY26 cash capex11.8497 crore and operating working-capital absorption are substantial, with8.3639 crore CWIP still uncommissioned.\"","\"The three-year window spans acquisition, restatement and the1.0276 crore noncash goodwill/securities-premium reclassification; a clean organic/acquired invested-capital and mature-cohort bridge is unavailable.\"","\"FY26 normalized operating profit improves and a one-year accounting incremental proxy can be calculated. It does not establish returns on new CBG/land or distinguish improved utilization of old plants from new capital productivity.\"","\"AR26 pp144–166\"","\"AR25 goodwill rollforward\"","\"IPO F56–58\"","2","\"High\"","\"CFO is negative for every FY22–26 year in the selected primary series; profitable FY24–26 CFO totals negative22.9126 crore.\"","\"FY26 CFO negative2.8470 includes4.6488 crore FD release; removing that financial-asset release gives analytical CFO negative7.4958, while cash capex is11.8497.\"","\"FY26 receivables grow much less than revenue and FY25 CFO deterioration partly reflects deposits, but repeated inventory/advances absorption and aged balances prevent treating the issue as one transitory build.\"","\"AR26 pp146,160–166\"","\"IPO F52\"","\"Normalized gross debt28.3579 crore includes23.0980 crore positive working-capital facilities; reported cash2.0582 includes1.3982 physical cash.\"","\"No undrawn facilities are disclosed, while capital creditors1.9551, tax provision1.8855 and term maturities1.0854 require cash; all modeled no-new-funding branches breach in the diagnostic pre-entry bridge.\"","\"Auditors report no default, term debt amortization is modest and EBITDA covers recorded interest. The stress is not proof of actual default or lender withdrawal; actual October cash and renewals remain unresolved.\"","\"AR26 pp144–146,150–173\"","\"model_inputs.json\"","\"Group manufacturing revenue has scaled after the Nirvaanraj acquisition, and both operating biodiesel sites are identified at170KLPD combined.\"","\"The Nov2025 CBG/pellet diversification timetable is not demonstrated as delivered by cutoff; October2026 document remains a registration/approval-stage announcement.\"","\"Acquisition integration and new OMC awards are tangible progress, but announcements, allocated tenders and carbon-credit issuance do not establish commissioned project cash returns.\"","\"AR26\"","\"FY26 parent-attributable PAT9.0623 exceeds FY25 restated comparative5.3663; clean operating EBITDA15.0556 excludes1.0598 other income.\"","\"FY26 group PAT10.5191 includes1.4568 attributable to minority holders; using the group headline or FY25 old pre-NCI EPS would overstate shareholder earnings.\"","\"Operating growth is real, not wholly subsidy-driven; FY25 subsidy0.90 crore, FY26 subsidy0.15 and inconsistent overview EBITDA require normalization. CASH is scored separately, not double-counted here.\"","\"AR26 pp144–146,162–166\"","\"Low\"","\"Every unfinanced path stops at its first pre-entry cash breach and generates no ordinary IRR.\"","\"Conditional rescue returns rely on uncommitted rollover, incremental loan and discounted equity; those cannot be substituted for a supported base-case investment return.\"","\"The bounded diagnostic can generate conditional prices and returns; numerical availability does not establish financing or current cash.\"","\"model_engine.py\"","\"A linked feedstock-margin and working-capital stress requires incremental capital despite reported accounting profit.\"","\"The bounded rescue bear branch still breaches before entry; the shareholder recovery diagnostic is severely exposed to debt and inventory/advance haircuts, rather than being assigned an ordinary post-breach IRR.\"","\"There is operating plant value and profitable demand, with no reported default. The low score represents a supported loss path, not a forecast of inevitable failure.\"","\"Reverse operating requirements are computed at the current price, but are conditional on cash availability and financing that are not established.\"","\"CBG, carbon credits and future subsidies are excluded rather than used to justify today's valuation.\"","\"Reported parent earnings imply a moderate headline PE. A low headline multiple alone cannot establish undemanding enterprise expectations when cash funding is unresolved.\"","\"Conservative60-session median gives14.913 days at5% participation for a5-lakh reference position, starting score3.\"","\"Current official lot500 costs103850 rupees, exceeding5% of median daily value; six absent/no-trade sessions and unavailable bid-ask depth justify one-point downgrade.\"","\"The security did trade on October19 and mean turnover is higher than median; no suspension is inferred. Current surveillance/circuit/quote depth still needs live execution verification.\"","\"market_extract.json\"","\"security_extract.json\"","\"terms\"","\"known_contribution\"","\"coverage\"","\"missing_weight\"","\"raw_bounds\"","\"cap\"","\"effective_bounds\"","\"final\"","\"display\"","\"factor\"","\"weight\"","\"contribution\"","\"0.20\"","\"1.00\"","\"0.60\"","\"0.12\"","\"0.50\"","\"0.08\"","\"0.24\"","\"0.40\"","\"2.94\"","\"0.76\"","\"3.18\"","\"5.34\"","\"NS\"","\"0.15\"","\"0.75\"","\"1.95\"","\"0.45\"","\"0.55\"","\"2.50\"","\"7.45\"","\"underlying_weighted_evidence_coverage\"","\"literal_missing_factor_bounds\"","\"bound_method\"","\"BQS_final\"","\"0.4900\"","\"1.30\"","\"7.60\"","\"1.8450\"","\"6.4350\"","\"Nested BQS bounds reused exactly; R/P vary1–10, no renormalization; gates independently block favorable classification.\"","\"BQS_bound_shift\"","\"IAS_bound_shift\"","\"GQS_bound_shift\"","-1","\"-0.20\"","\"-0.0500\"","1","\"-0.08\"","\"-0.0200\"","\"0.0200\"","\"id\"","\"status\"","\"reason\"","\"resolution\"","\"G1\"","\"Conditional\"","\"No substantiated severe integrity failure in audits reviewed; demand RPT recoverability and cash/FD availability require clarification.\"","\"Obtain repayment schedules, confirmations, recoverability and board approvals for material related-party loans.\"","\"G2\"","\"Hold — unresolved\"","\"Latest audit is unmodified, but historical restatement/AR comparative differences and overview EBITDA versus P&L are material to a long-run incremental-return claim; no unfavorable allegation is inferred.\"","\"Reconcile IPO restated FY24 capital/cashflow to later comparative, obtain consistent parent-attributable EPS and organic volume/price bridge.\"","\"G3\"","\"No proven default. Actual October cash, restrictions, headroom and renewals are not established; diagnostic pre-entry stress breaches without optional finance.\"","\"Current bank statements, facility utilization/renewals, monthly collections, subsidiary fungibility and fully funded capex commitments.\"","\"G4\"","\"Observed trading and current lot established; order-book spread, circuits, current surveillance and execution feasibility remain unverified.\"","\"Exchange restriction checks and executable quote/depth at time of proposed trade; do not treat master market-maker field as bid-ask spread.\"","\"Hold — unresolved; pending evidence, not ranking eligible\"","\"audit_scope\"","\"latest_operating_capital\"","\"capital_definition\"","\"noncash_history_bridge\"","\"shareholding\"","\"subsidiaries\"","\"earnings_corrections\"","\"aged_assets\"","\"promises_delivery\"","\"peers\"","\"open_questions\"","\"IPO\"","\"Standalone opinion, CARO, IFC, consolidated opinion, CARO and notes reviewed; unmodified, no reported fraud/default/statutory resignation. Subsidiary IFC exemption is not a group-wide tested-controls opinion.\"","\"Standalone/consolidated audit, CARO, financial tables and restatement-sensitive comparatives reviewed.\"","\"Risk factors, customer/supplier and volume tables, acquisition history, restated statements F45–58 and reconciliations read. No unqualified five-year organic series claimed.\"","\"ONWC includes inventory, trade receivables, supplier/employee advances, GST ITC/TDS and operating deposits/prepaids, less trade/operating payables and employee/lease provisions; excludes financing cash/FDs, income tax balances, directors/other nonoperating advances and capital creditors. IC adds productive PPE, all CWIP, goodwill and operating long-term deposits. Funding bridge adds excluded capital-creditor and income/deferred-tax funding back. Source note-rounding residual0.0001crore retained, not forced away.\"","\"FY2025_goodwill_reclassification\"","\"nature\"","\"FY2024_restatement\"","\"1.0276\"","\"Pre-acquisition securities-premium adjustment, not impairment, cash disposal or evidence of capital withdrawal.\"","\"IPO-restated FY24 and AR25 comparative differ in cashflow/working-capital/equity presentation; both retained separately. No stitched three-year incremental ROIC is assigned.\"","\"date\"","\"promoter_shares\"","\"promoter_percent_reported\"","\"public_shares\"","\"public_percent_reported\"","\"holders\"","\"locked_shares\"","\"locked_percent\"","\"promoter_pledge_reported\"","\"other_encumbrance_reported\"","\"convertibles_warrants_esops_reported\"","\"cutoff_limit\"","\"2026-03-31\"","7033500","4626000","\"65.77\"","2407500","\"34.23\"","808","1406700","\"20\"","false","\"SHP26 pp1–3\"","\"September2026 primary filing not located; March snapshot is not proof of October encumbrance status.\"","\"name\"","\"ownership\"","\"acquired\"","\"FY26_revenue\"","\"FY26_PAT\"","\"FY26_equity\"","\"Nirvaanraj Energy Private Limited\"","\"0.7521\"","\"2024-03-28\"","\"69.1068\"","\"5.8765\"","\"10.4601\"","\"formed\"","\"FY26_loss\"","\"FY26_assets\"","\"Rajputana Agro LLP\"","\"0.99\"","\"2026-03-16\"","\"0.0020\"","\"3.8245\"","\"consideration\"","\"reported_turnover\"","\"valued_optionality\"","\"Arvant Bioenergy Private Limited\"","\"1\"","\"2026-08-25\"","\"0.0010\"","\"FY26_clean_operating_EBITDA\"","\"FY26_overview_EBITDA\"","\"difference\"","\"FY25_old_EPS_pre_NCI\"","\"FY25_AR26_parent_EPS\"","\"FY26_parent_PAT\"","\"FY26_group_PAT\"","\"FY26_NCI_PAT\"","\"FY26_FD_release_in_CFO\"","\"FY26_CFO_excluding_FD_release\"","\"FY26_cash_bridge_rounding_residual\"","\"15.8157\"","\"0.7601\"","\"10.29\"","\"9.33\"","\"1.4568\"","\"4.6488\"","\"-7.4958\"","\"disputed_receivable_over3years\"","\"undisputed_receivable1to2years\"","\"undisputed_receivable2to3years\"","\"doubtful_supplier_advance\"","\"recorded_provision\"","\"physical_cash\"","\"pledged_FD\"","\"0.6572\"","\"2.8702\"","\"0.1915\"","\"0.4421\"","\"1.3982\"","\"0.142208\"","\"claim\"","\"status_at_cutoff\"","\"2025-11-18\"","\"Improve utilization and commission diversification within following year; high CBG margin guidance\"","\"Biodiesel scaling supported; unit-volume utilization bridge absent. October6 CBG document only registration and approvals pending, no commissioning/cash proof.\"","\"CALL25;CBG26\"","\"2026-05-27\"","\"170KLPD biodiesel capacity and circular-business opportunity\"","\"Capacity claim retained as reported capacity, not production or normalized economic return. Carbon-credit cash receipts not verified.\"","\"PRES26;AR26\"","\"2026-08-22\"","\"Acquire Arvant\"","\"CompletedAugust25 for10000rupees; zero-turnover vehicle not a cash-generating acquisition.\"","\"ACQ26;ACQDONE26\"","\"comparison\"","\"Kotyark Industries\"","\"Closest listed biodiesel/glycerine tender/feedstock comparator; no unverified peer multiple used.\"","\"https://www.kotyark.com/biodisel\"","\"Undated product description used only for business overlap.\"","\"Universal Biofuels (Aemetis subsidiary)\"","\"India biodiesel/refined glycerin operator, competing OMC allocation model; February2025 restart approval illustrates plant/regulatory execution risk.\"","\"https://aemetis.com/aemetis-india-plant-approved-by-government-to-restart-biodiesel-production/\"","\"Dated24February2025. US parent valuation not comparable.\"","\"Emami Agrotech\"","\"Integrated edible-oil/biodiesel producer offers potentially stronger feedstock integration; unlisted, no clean comparable enterprise multiple.\"","\"https://www.emamigroup.com/group-of-companies/agrotech/bio-diesel-edible-oils-and-foods/\"","\"Business overlap only; current undated capacity and largest-producer marketing not imported into cutoff valuation.\"","\"Actual October cash, bank utilization, facility renewals and restrictions, and cash fungibility across entities.\"","\"Comparable annual product volumes, realizations and raw-material yields, current customer/supplier concentration and tender dispatch versus allocation reconciliation.\"","\"Clean FY24 restated-to-comparative capital/cashflow reconciliation, long-run organic acquisition-capital bridge, and mature incremental project returns.\"","\"Recoverability and terms of related-party/other advances, aged/disputed receivables and doubtful supplier advances; inventory grade, saleability and NRV testing.\"","\"CBG land/title, complete permits, budget, EPC commitments, credible feedstock cost/yield, offtake and signed financing/subsidy eligibility and receipts.\"","\"Current promoter encumbrance, surveillance/circuit rules, executable quote depth and lot-constrained exit plan.\"","\"authorized_shares\"","\"horizon_years\"","\"equity_hurdle\"","\"units\"","\"opening\"","\"assumptions\"","\"cash_conventions\"","\"cases\"","\"8000000\"","\"INR crore; integer shares; per-share INR; all forward operating/funding variables are analyst assumptions, not guidance or commitments\"","\"excluded_ipo_cash\"","\"reported_cash\"","\"pledged_fd\"","\"negative_cc_credit_not_available\"","\"revolver\"","\"term_debt\"","\"other_debt\"","\"other_operating_assets\"","\"operating_liabilities\"","\"capital_creditors\"","\"old_tax\"","\"capacity_revenue_proxy\"","\"2.0560\"","\"0.0022\"","\"4.0670\"","\"0.2141\"","\"23.0980\"","\"5.0648\"","\"0.1951\"","\"minimum_cash\"","\"tax_rate\"","\"receipts_front_fraction\"","\"legacy_revolver_rate\"","\"term_rate\"","\"rescue_rate\"","\"rescue_bank_cap\"","\"rescue_bank_fee\"","\"rescue_equity_fee\"","\"rescue_issue_fraction\"","\"terminal_wacc\"","\"terminal_growth\"","\"nci_economic_fraction\"","\"fixed_capital_to_sales\"","\"maintenance_capex_to_sales\"","\"depreciation_to_sales\"","\"fd_realization_fraction\"","\"nonoperating_recovery\"","\"cwip_recovery\"","\"additional_project_capex\"","\"terminal_EV_multiplier\"","\"0.25\"","\"0.085\"","\"0.01\"","\"0.03\"","\"0.70\"","\"0.04\"","\"0.1384911291831335\"","\"0.012\"","\"0.009\"","\"Model starts 31 March 2026, not at investment entry. Seven equal pre-entry buckets span 202 days through 19 October. These are diagnostic interpolations, not reported interim results.\"","\"Pre-entry sales run rate interpolates from audited FY26 revenue to each case year1 target. Subsequent five years use 12 equal buckets each. First event includes all operating cash costs, tax, interest, debt principal, capex and positive WC absorption, net of front-loaded receipts. Second event includes remaining receipts and WC releases. Insolvency is checked at BOTH events, not just year end.\"","\"Forward after-interest operating cash = EBITDA minus cash interest minus normalized cash tax minus change in defined noncash operating working capital. Old tax provision and capital creditors are separately paid; capital creditors are excluded from operating liabilities. Model cashflows do not duplicate depreciation or cash FD balances.\"","\"No incremental facility, rollover, equity or subsidy is committed in the no-new-funding branch. Existing revolver runs off over first 12 months as a conservative unavailable-renewal diagnostic, not a documented lender demand.\"","\"Optional rescue branch ASSUMES existing revolver renews throughout horizon at 12%; incremental rescue loan is capped, fees charged, and repays over 36 months starting model month13. New equity never exceeds present authorized share headroom, priced at an assumed 30% discount, fees3%, rounded UP to whole shares at each event. Neither legal approval nor investor or bank commitment is established.\"","\"A failed branch stops immediately. No terminal valuation, ordinary return, or continuation after failure is generated. Economic recovery is considered separately, not an ordinary equity IRR.\"","\"Terminal value uses year6 after-tax operating cash minus maintenance and incremental working/fixed capital at terminal growth, discounted as FCFF/(WACC-growth). It is not a chosen exit multiple. Interest, tax shields and debt service are included in explicit cash survival; terminal enterprise value is debt-free FCFF. Terminal debt is deducted exactly once, cash above minimum added once, NCI applies proportionately to residual operating equity. No value for CBG, carbon credits, subsidiaries without cash flow, remaining CWIP, advances or unavailable FD unless explicit sensitivity.\"","\"Pre-entry equity is prohibited to preserve observed October19 shares. Counterfactual bank rollover/drawdown is diagnostic only; actual bridge remains unknown. Tiny Decimal residuals below1e-28 crore are zero, not a whole-share capital raise. Terminal excess cash is added only after retaining the peak intramonth year6 requirement, and year6 liquidity starts with that retained reserve, never with distributed cash. Productive PPE stock is rolled by cash capex minus depreciation; every bucket funds at least 0.12 crore productive assets per incremental crore annual sales above FY26. Opening CWIP remains stranded, earns nothing and receives zero recovery.\"","\"Other operating assets12.6960 =4.9205 non-income-tax short-term advances +7.7755 operating OCA; GST ITC and GST TDS remain operating. NCI13.8491% is FY26 minority/PAT mix proxy, not ownership; sensitivity tests0% and24.79%. Terminal FCFF includes growth of peak operating cash reserve; year6 must end with enough cash for its growth. Additional project-capex sensitivity is stranded CWIP, never productive PPE or earnings.\"","\"Opening operating assets12.6960 and operating liabilities6.9924 match the selective audited IC bridge. Liabilities comprise5.7236 trade payables +3.0873 other current liabilities −1.9551 capital creditors +0.1162 long-term employee provisions +0.0204 short-term employee/lease provisions. Capital creditors and tax remain separately paid.\"","\"Lower-terminal-multiple stress applies0.75 to earned terminal enterprise value only. Operating cash, retained cash reserve, financing, shares and all failure states are unchanged. This is an analyst valuation compression, not a further haircut to operating cash or a change in financing commitments.\"","\"bear\"","\"base\"","\"bull\"","\"margin\"","\"inventory_ratio\"","\"receivable_ratio\"","\"other_asset_ratio\"","\"operating_liability_ratio\"","\"growth_capex\"","\"110\"","\"105\"","\"115\"","\"120\"","\"0.07\"","\"0.065\"","\"0.075\"","\"0.32\"","\"0.16\"","\"0.105\"","\"140\"","\"160\"","\"180\"","\"200\"","\"220\"","\"0.27\"","\"0.09\"","\"0.06\"","\"2\"","\"250\"","\"300\"","\"350\"","\"0.13\"","\"0.135\"","\"0.14\"","\"0.22\"","\"label\"","\"case\"","\"optional_rescue\"","\"assumption_changes\"","\"breach\"","\"first_rescue\"","\"minimum_cash_observed\"","\"bank_gross_drawn\"","\"equity_gross_raised\"","\"financing_fees\"","\"new_shares\"","\"ending_shares\"","\"authorized_headroom\"","\"issue_price\"","\"ending_cash\"","\"ending_debt\"","\"annual_endpoints\"","\"ordinary_irr\"","\"conditional_irr\"","\"terminal\"","\"bear_no_funding\"","\"BREACH\"","\"month\"","\"phase\"","\"shortfall_to_floor\"","\"costs_before_remaining_receipts\"","\"pre_entry\"","\"-6.126274264098406485882024042493709812697\"","\"6.626274264098406485882024042493709812697\"","0","966500","\"145.3900\"","\"26.44594430528375733855185909980430528376\"","\"bear_rescue\"","true","\"-0.6912914197695038827846989580438824275920\"","\"1.191291419769503882784698958043882427592\"","\"5.00000000000000000000000